/**
 * @defgroup MIDILAR MIDILAR
 * @brief Portable MIDI protocol, parsing and device processing built on
 * Foundation, DspCore and MCC.
 *
 * MIDILAR uses the `MIDILAR` namespace and consumes the stable CMake targets
 * `Foundation::Foundation`, `DspCore::DspCore` and `MCC::MCC`. Applications may include `MIDILAR.h` for the complete
 * enabled surface or a documented module/component header for narrow access.
 */
